  "description": "<p>This ticket is to add a configuration option to allow users to choose between upgrading existing objects (on write) to the current version of OCFL implemented by Fedora or leave them as the older version.</p>\n\n<p>This uses the <tt>.setUpgradeObjectsOnWrite(true)</tt> flag described at <a href=\"https://github.com/UW-Madison-Library/ocfl-java#upgrading-ocfl-repositories\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/UW-Madison-Library/ocfl-java#upgrading-ocfl-repositories</a></p>",
